    {
      "id": "09-cons",
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "cons",
      "text": "Cons next: needs cooking before it works. It is not a grab-and-go food. Prep method changes it fast. Fries, butter, and heavy toppings can drag it down. Plain flavour often needs help. The simple potato does not always stay simple.",
      "textSha256": "3b0288021146f657446db53107f03acc7d4cbdec8e2a4a7abe0bcd3c6c2effc5",
